  <section>
    <div class="wide">
      <p>Your request trace can follow an email from admission through connection acquisition, submission, retries and cleanup.
        The optional OpenTelemetry integration records that work directly; it does not depend on a progress callback arriving or a result observer running.</p>
      <p>Use <a href="/analyzing-send-results.html">receipts and result observers</a> for individual submission decisions,
        <a href="/analyzing-send-results.html#section-live-progress">progress</a> for a best-effort current state, and telemetry for traces and aggregated measurements.
        None of them proves final mailbox delivery.</p>
      <p>The <a href="/analyzing-send-results.html#section-observation-options">observation comparison</a> shows which questions each facility answers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
